  m_text: "Press Alt Fire to attach a cable that <color=#FF4343>slowly charges</color> a powerful <color=#FF4343>electric shock</color>.\n\nAttached cables <color=#FF4343>persist</color> when <color=#FF4343>switching weapons</color>."
